                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We have a 30-day return policy, which means you have 30 days after receiving your item to request a return. To be eligible for a return, your item must be in the same condition that you received it, unworn or unused, with tags, and in its original packaging. </p>",
