            "accordion_row_bVnYme": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Which Pattern should I choose?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_CECkyV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our Summit pattern is very effective in the spring and early fall, while Solace tends to be favored in the later season. Both patterns are built with concealment algorithms that are designed to move with you through multiple habitat environments. Many of our prostaff and loyal customers have used both patterns throughout the season with great success. </p><p>Learn more <a href=\"https://skregear.com/pages/which-pattern-to-choose\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https://skregear.com/pages/which-pattern-to-choose</span></a></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
